1,Bailang language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bailang_language,"April 11, 2026 - For example, the word for ""gorge"" is transcribed with the character 龍, whose Old Chinese form is reconstructed by Li Fang-Kuei as *gljung. Coblin argues that the Bailang word retains the consonant cluster of Proto-Sino-Tibetan *klu·ŋ, which has been lost in Proto-Lolo-Burmese *loŋ3.",Lang’e,Sino-Tibetan
