9,"Tibetan Music, Tibetan Songs - Tibet Travel",https://www.tibetguru.com/tibetan-arts/tibetan-music.htm,"Singing, loud and sonorous, has romantic color, expressing the Tibetans religious belief and their enjoying happy lives and peaceful minds. The integration with the nature and many other new music styles characterizes Tibetan music, which may be perfectly connected to pop music.",Lang’e,Sino-Tibetan
